{'symbol': 'GL', 'date': '2021-08-23 17:30:00', 'title': 'GLOBE LIFE INC. DECLARES DIVIDEND', 'text': "MCKINNEY, TEXAS, AUG. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GLOBE LIFE INC. (NYSE: GL) ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $.1975\xa0PER SHARE ON ALL OF THE OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY HELD OF RECORD AS OF CLOSE OF BUSINESS OF THE COMPANY'S TRANSFER AGENT ON OCTOBER 4, 2021.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON NOVEMBER 1, 2021."}